Verification legend
-------------------
IMPLEMENTED & VERIFIED      tested locally, including real external calls where noted
LIVE-VERIFIED               exercised against the real external service with a real credential
ADAPTER IMPLEMENTED         code follows the documented interface; no live credential was used
